      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAPPY ESCAPE (10) has recorded three wins and two minor placings from the past five starts. Settled in the leading division then went to the front and was able to maintain the advantage to score again in a 2120m race at St Arnaud last start, arriving 1.1 metres ahead of his rivals to make it two successive victories. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. Won't find this any harder and he can go right on with the job. MATISOFF (8) registered a strong performance last time when he battled on bravely to just miss out over 2195m at Ararat. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. Good enough to put himself in the winners' stall. SAINT EYES (2) has to come into calculations on the back of some strong recent form, most recently when second at this track over 1690m. Must be included. FRANCO AMERICANO (7) was out of the money two runs ago then broke and finished sixth last start over 1720m at Melton. Each-way.",
